# Workers Assets 配信用のセキュリティヘッダー。値は src/middleware.js の SECURITY_HEADERS と同じ（test/worker.test.js で一致を確認）
/*
  Content-Security-Policy: default-src 'self'; img-src 'self' data: https://images-na.ssl-images-amazon.com https://m.media-amazon.com https://ndlsearch.ndl.go.jp; script-src 'self' 'unsafe-inline'; style-src 'self' 'unsafe-inline' https://fonts.googleapis.com; font-src https://fonts.gstatic.com; connect-src 'self'; frame-ancestors 'none'; base-uri 'self'; form-action 'self'
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
  X-Frame-Options: DENY
